WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
For spring break, I'm pretty much just going to go back home,

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.480
gonna skate a little bit, get to see my chihuahuas again.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:09.380
I might get a tattoo, but we haven't fully figured that out.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:14.100
I will be on a trip off of Key West in Florida

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.680
on a research cruise for an oceanography class.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.780
I'm headed to Colorado to play some lacrosse games with the MIT Lacrosse team.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.480
I'm going home for a couple days, and then

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.560
going to Spain with my two best friends for like a week.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:30.480
I'm going to be rowing crew here, so I'm gonna be stuck on campus for spring break.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.860
But it's okay. We have a great time on the Charles.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.900
I'm gonna go to Connecticut to go see my girlfriend's parents,

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:40.180
which is exciting, but also a little nerve-wracking.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:44.000
I'm gonna be going to London with 15 of my best friends.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.560
I'm a member of the Logarhythms. My whole a capella group is going on spring tour.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:50.580
So I'm in TPP, Technology and Policy Program.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:53.200
Every year they organize this trip to D.C.,

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:58.060
and we're gonna meet, like, some policymakers down there.

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:01.100
I will be sitting out by the pool as much as possible,

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:05.840
and trying to get a tan. It's not gonna happen, but I will make the attempt.

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:10.800
I am going home tomorrow, which is really exciting. I haven't seen my parents in a while.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.800
So it's nice to, you know, get a break from schoolwork and go back and hang out with family.

